      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im prepping for a law moot court competition and i'm stuck. the topic is the scope of executive privilege vs congressional oversight. basically, in the context of modern governance, is the expansion of executive privilege a necessary protection for the presidency or a dangerous erosion of checks and balances? please just pick the stronger legal position for me so i know which way to lean for my arguments.",
